@startuml
participant Browser
participant API
participant Domain
participant Galla
participant DB
Browser -> API: POST /api/pos/bills/void { billId }
API -> Domain: voidBill(billId)
Domain -> DB: mark bill voided
DB --> Domain: voided bill
Domain -> Galla: emit REFUND_CASH(amount)
Galla -> DB: insert GallaEvent
DB --> Galla: persisted
Domain --> API: void result
API --> Browser: 200 OK
@enduml